+    $$
+    p' = p + \Delta p
+    $$
 
 3.  **Density Query:**
-    For canonical point $p'$:
-    a. Perform trilinear interpolation on $G_\sigma$: $v_\sigma = \text{interp}(p', G_\sigma)$ [S1].
